<title>POLAND: Polish c.bank rejects all bids at drainage.</title>
<headline>Polish c.bank rejects all bids at drainage.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland rejected all 103 million zlotys worth of bids at its six and 14-day reverse repo auction on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 2 653 9700</p>
</text>
